  Helper templates

template< class T >

constexpr bool enable_borrowed_range<std::ranges::as_rvalue_view<T>> =  (since C++23)

ranges::enable_borrowed_range<T>;

This specialization of std::ranges::enable_borrowed_range makes as_rvalue_view satisfy
borrowed_range when the underlying view satisfies it.

